<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1. The above Financial Results have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors in their respective meetings held on 11th February, 2020.  2. In accordance with Regulation 33 of the SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015, the statutory auditors of the company have carried out limited review of the above results.  3. The figures of the previous period have been regrouped/rearranged wherever necessary to make them comparable with those of current period.  4. The Figures of the Quarter ended December 31, 2019 are the balancing figures between figures for the Year to date period ended on December 31, 2019 and Half Year ended on 30th September, 2019.   5. Financial Results for all the periods have been prepared in accordance with Accounting Standards as prescribed by the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India.  6. As our company migrated from SME to the Main Board of NSE w.e.f. August 02, 2019, Ind AS will be applicable to our company from the next Financial Year i.e. 2020-21.   7. EPS is calculated as per Accounting Standard 20 considering the split up of equity shares and accordingly EPS is adjusted for all the comparative periods presented.   8. The Management identifies Paper-Trading as the only Business Segment.   9. The above financial results are available on the Website of the Company i.e. www.shrenik.co.in and on the Website of National Stock Exchange of India i.e. www.nseindia.com.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
